          <definition> To unbridle.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠮᠠᠭᠠᠢ ᠶᠠᠷ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jar-a</transcript>
          <definition> Pustules in the mouth, canker sores.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠮᠠᠭᠠᠢ ᠵᠠᠭᠤᠯᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- zaγulγaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To bridle; to restrain, control, keep in check.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
